PROHIBITED USES

Use of this software to simulate, design, or optimize any of the following
is expressly prohibited under this license:

1. Chemical weapons or precursors listed under the Chemical Weapons
   Convention Schedule 1, 2, or 3.
2. Biological select agents as defined by the CDC/USDA Select Agent Program.
3. Gain-of-function research on any BSL-3 or BSL-4 pathogen.
4. Any material or protein intended to cause harm to human life.

Violation of these terms terminates your license immediately and may
constitute a violation of applicable law. All simulation activity is
logged locally. Orders of Magnitude LLC reserves the right to cooperate
fully with any lawful government inquiry.
